          "id": "nutshell",
          "label": "Nutshell",
          "startSec": 341.110909090909,
          "endSec": 355.38818181818175,
          "text": "In a nutshell, Tactus is a high-level agent programming model, with default-on sandboxing and container isolation, capability and context control, human-in-the-loop gates, and durable checkpoints so long-running workflows can pause, resume, and be audited safely.",
          "segments": [
            {
              "type": "pause",
              "startSec": 341.110909090909,
              "endSec": 342.310909090909,
              "durationSec": 1.2
            },
            {
              "type": "tts",
              "startSec": 342.310909090909,
              "endSec": 355.0381818181817,
              "text": "In a nutshell, Tactus is a high-level agent programming model, with default-on sandboxing and container isolation, capability and context control, human-in-the-loop gates, and durable checkpoints so long-running workflows can pause, resume, and be audited safely."
            },
            {
